OL,3,ASir Tom Jones 'truly sorry' as he
OL,4,Acancels two shows due to illness
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a post on Instagram, he wrote:
OL,7,F"Following doctor's advice, I
OL,8,Funfortunately have to reschedule
OL,9,Ftonight's show in Los Angeles and
OL,10,Ftomorrow's show in San Diego."
